  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renewable Energy and Adaptation Climate Technologies (Africa Enterprise Challenge Fund)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To stimulate private sector investment in developing low cost, clean energy and climate change technologies and services, such as solar power, biomass energy, irrigation and crop insurance products for small holder farmers. Every business supported by REACT must demonstrate a positive impact on the rural poor through increased incomes, employment and productivity or by reducing costs.</narrative>
  </description>
